  "title": "Part IV: Breaking Down Data Analytics and AI in Criminal Justice",
  "summary": "In recent years, artificial intelligence and data analytics have exploded in popularity. The criminal justice tech space is no exception: many new tools are AI-enabled, including algorithmic risk assessments, facial recognition, and gunshot detection. But these tools aren’t perfect. This posts walks through the differences between common types of tools, and provides practical, actionable advice to practitioners for use during the procurement and deployment process.",
